<ul id="mwEGI"><li id="mwEGM">«<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwEGQ"> </span>Gustave Eiffel<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwEGU"> </span>: Le Géant du fer<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwEGY"> </span>» par Joël Alessandra, Eddy Simon et Philippe Coupérie Eiffel - Éditions <span about="#mwt660" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEGc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unité","href":"./Modèle:Unité"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"21"},"2":{"wt":"g"}},"i":0}}]}'>21 </span><abbr class="abbr" title="gramme" about="#mwt660" id="mwEGg">g</abbr> - 2015 – <span about="#mwt661" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEGk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Modèle:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"979-10-93111-04-9"}},"i":0}}]}'> </span><small style="line-height:1em;" about="#mwt661" id="mwEGo">(<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Standard_Book_Number" title="International Standard Book Number">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spécial:Ouvrages_de_référence/979-10-93111-04-9" title="Spécial:Ouvrages de référence/979-10-93111-04-9"><span class="nowrap">979-10-93111-04-9</span></a>)</small></li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="67" id="mwEGs" aria-labelledby="Autres_ouvrages"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Autres_ouvrages">Autres ouvrages</h3></div>
